userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: When a stopcock between two bulbs is opened, initially separated gases diffuse through the connecting tube and gradually form a mixed distribution in both bulbs.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): Opening the stopcock allows random molecular motion to carry each gas into the other bulb, changing the system from separated gases to a mixed distribution over time.
DEMO STEPS: 4 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

